      "title": "GENERIC_RECOVERY_DECISION_PROTOCOL",
      "requirement": "One generic Recovery Decision Protocol selects RESULT_VALIDATION_ONLY, FINALIZATION_ONLY, RETRY_EXECUTOR or HUMAN_RISK_REVIEW from receipts, effect certainty, event commit, grant state, checkpoint and retry budget.",
